Type: Package
Title: A Collection of Customizable Graphs
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Giuseppe Giorgio Colabufo <giuseppe.colabufo.2016@polytechnique.org>
Maintainer: Giuseppe Giorgio Colabufo <giuseppe.colabufo.2016@polytechnique.org>
Description: This package provides functions to create various types of customizable graphs, including sparkline plots, chord diagrams, lollipop graphs, and slope graphs.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
